1
00:00:03,439 --> 00:00:04,940
Water...

2
00:00:05,858 --> 00:00:07,276
Earth...

3
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:09,528
Fire...

4
00:00:09,904 --> 00:00:11,363
Air.

5
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:16,159
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:16,327 --> 00:00:20,289
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:20,999 --> 00:00:23,417
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

8
00:00:23,501 --> 00:00:24,710
could stop them.

9
00:00:24,794 --> 00:00:26,295
But when the world needed him most,

10
00:00:26,379 --> 00:00:27,629
he vanished.

11
00:00:28,339 --> 00:00:29,715
100 years passed,

12
00:00:29,799 --> 00:00:31,883
and my brother and I
discovered the new Avatar--

13
00:00:31,968 --> 00:00:33,593
an airbender named Aang.

14
00:00:33,928 --> 00:00:35,971
And although
his airbending skills are great,

15
00:00:36,055 --> 00:00:38,682
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

16
00:00:38,766 --> 00:00:39,891
Oof.

17
00:00:39,976 --> 00:00:42,811
But I believe Aang can save the world.

18
00:01:03,666 --> 00:01:05,417
I can't believe I lost him.

19
00:01:05,501 --> 00:01:07,294
You did everything you could.

20
00:01:07,712 --> 00:01:09,171
And now we need to
do everything we can

21
00:01:09,255 --> 00:01:10,630
to get him back.

22
00:01:10,715 --> 00:01:11,882
Zuko can't have gotten far.

23
00:01:11,966 --> 00:01:13,091
We'll find him.

24
00:01:13,551 --> 00:01:14,801
Aang's gonna be fine.

25
00:01:14,886 --> 00:01:15,886
Ok.

26
00:01:20,767 --> 00:01:21,808
It's all right.

27
00:01:21,893 --> 00:01:22,934
You stay here, Momo--

28
00:01:23,019 --> 00:01:24,394
In case Aang comes back.

29
00:01:24,479 --> 00:01:25,479
Yip, yip!

30
00:01:50,463 --> 00:01:52,881
Om.

31
00:01:53,633 --> 00:01:55,300
Om.

32
00:01:55,385 --> 00:01:56,718
Hello?

33
00:01:56,803 --> 00:01:58,053
I'm sorry to disturb you.

34
00:01:58,137 --> 00:01:59,554
I just really need to find

35
00:01:59,639 --> 00:02:00,764
the moon and the ocean spirits.

36
00:02:01,265 --> 00:02:03,016
Go away.

37
00:02:05,770 --> 00:02:07,104
You're still here?

38
00:02:07,188 --> 00:02:08,271
Yes, I need--

39
00:02:08,356 --> 00:02:10,565
Om!

40
00:02:11,067 --> 00:02:12,776
Perhaps that thing will help you.

41
00:02:12,860 --> 00:02:14,027
Chase it!

42
00:02:16,739 --> 00:02:17,739
Finally.

43
00:02:26,082 --> 00:02:27,082
Come back!

44
00:02:29,877 --> 00:02:31,753
Hello, Aang.

45
00:02:31,838 --> 00:02:32,921
Roku?!

46
00:02:57,864 --> 00:02:58,864
Shelter!

47
00:03:10,001 --> 00:03:12,252
Roku, the water tribe is under attack!

48
00:03:12,336 --> 00:03:14,671
I need to find
the ocean and the moon spirits.

49
00:03:16,382 --> 00:03:19,801
The ocean and the moon
are ancient spirits--

50
00:03:20,094 --> 00:03:22,429
They crossed over
from the spirit world

51
00:03:22,513 --> 00:03:25,807
to the mortal world
very near the beginning.

52
00:03:26,058 --> 00:03:28,268
There is only one spirit I know of

53
00:03:28,519 --> 00:03:31,062
who is old enough to remember...

54
00:03:31,147 --> 00:03:32,355
Who?

55
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:35,150
The spirit's name is Koh,

56
00:03:35,234 --> 00:03:37,152
but he is very dangerous--

57
00:03:37,695 --> 00:03:40,864
They call him the Face Stealer.

58
00:03:41,407 --> 00:03:42,782
When you speak with him,

59
00:03:42,867 --> 00:03:44,951
you must be very careful

60
00:03:45,036 --> 00:03:46,953
to show no emotion at all--

61
00:03:47,121 --> 00:03:49,956
Not the slightest expression--

62
00:03:50,041 --> 00:03:52,709
Or he will steal your face.

63
00:04:12,021 --> 00:04:13,271
I finally have you,

64
00:04:13,940 --> 00:04:16,608
but I can't get you home
because of this blizzard.

65
00:04:16,692 --> 00:04:18,151
There's always something.

66
00:04:18,736 --> 00:04:20,362
Not that you would understand.

67
00:04:20,780 --> 00:04:22,405
You're like my sister.

68
00:04:22,490 --> 00:04:24,574
Everything always came easy to her.

69
00:04:24,659 --> 00:04:26,618
She's a firebending prodigy...

70
00:04:26,702 --> 00:04:28,453
And everyone adores her.

71
00:04:28,788 --> 00:04:30,747
My father says she was born lucky.

72
00:04:30,831 --> 00:04:33,083
He says I was lucky to be born.

73
00:04:34,460 --> 00:04:35,502
I don't need luck, though--

74
00:04:35,586 --> 00:04:37,212
I don't want it.

75
00:04:37,547 --> 00:04:39,089
I've always had to struggle and fight,

76
00:04:39,173 --> 00:04:40,924
and that's made me strong...

77
00:04:41,008 --> 00:04:42,676
It's made me who I am.

78
00:05:13,124 --> 00:05:14,374
I don't need to remind you

79
00:05:14,458 --> 00:05:15,625
we have a time limit.

80
00:05:16,210 --> 00:05:17,877
If we don't defeat the water tribe

81
00:05:17,962 --> 00:05:19,838
before the full moon rises,

82
00:05:19,922 --> 00:05:21,715
they will be undefeatable.

83
00:05:21,799 --> 00:05:23,008
I assure you--

84
00:05:23,092 --> 00:05:24,759
I have everything under control.

85
00:05:25,052 --> 00:05:27,804
I intend to remove
the moon as a factor.

86
00:05:28,139 --> 00:05:29,389
Remove the moon?

87
00:05:29,473 --> 00:05:30,599
How?

88
00:05:30,683 --> 00:05:32,017
Admiral Choi!

89
00:05:33,603 --> 00:05:35,520
Prepare to meet your fate!

90
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,189
Whoa!

91
00:05:39,358 --> 00:05:40,775
As I was saying.

92
00:05:41,235 --> 00:05:42,861
Years ago, I stumbled upon

93
00:05:42,945 --> 00:05:44,988
a great and powerful secret--

94
00:05:45,531 --> 00:05:48,617
The identity of the moon spirit's
mortal form.

95
00:05:49,035 --> 00:05:50,035
What?!

96
00:05:50,369 --> 00:05:51,453
I was a young lieutenant

97
00:05:51,537 --> 00:05:53,705
serving under General Xu
in the Earth Kingdom.

98
00:05:54,457 --> 00:05:55,999
I discovered a hidden library--

99
00:05:56,083 --> 00:05:57,500
Underground, in fact.

100
00:05:57,918 --> 00:06:00,545
I tore through scroll after scroll.

101
00:06:00,796 --> 00:06:03,673
One of them contained
a detailed illustration--

102
00:06:03,758 --> 00:06:06,718
And the words "moon" and "ocean."

103
00:06:07,053 --> 00:06:09,721
I knew then that these spirits
could be found...

104
00:06:09,805 --> 00:06:11,264
And killed...

105
00:06:12,475 --> 00:06:14,893
And that it was my destiny to do so.

106
00:06:15,102 --> 00:06:18,021
Zhao, the spirits
are not to be trifled with!

107
00:06:18,481 --> 00:06:22,525
Yes, yes, I know
you fear the spirits, Iroh--

108
00:06:22,610 --> 00:06:23,902
I have heard rumors about your journey

109
00:06:23,986 --> 00:06:25,904
into the spirit world.

110
00:06:25,988 --> 00:06:28,156
But the ocean and moon
gave up their immortality

111
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:30,325
to become a part of our world.

112
00:06:30,910 --> 00:06:33,536
And now they will
face the consequences.

113
00:06:53,641 --> 00:06:55,433
You're just a curly-tailed bluenose.

114
00:07:01,649 --> 00:07:03,149
Show no fear.

115
00:07:03,234 --> 00:07:05,026
Show no emotion at all.

116
00:07:18,749 --> 00:07:19,749
Hello?

117
00:07:19,834 --> 00:07:22,502
I'm looking for a spirit named Koh.

118
00:07:35,599 --> 00:07:36,808
Welcome.

119
00:07:39,645 --> 00:07:40,729
Thank you.

120
00:07:40,813 --> 00:07:43,690
My old friend, the Avatar--

121
00:07:44,108 --> 00:07:46,735
It's been a long time.

122
00:07:46,819 --> 00:07:48,027
You know me?

123
00:07:48,487 --> 00:07:50,822
How could I forget you?

124
00:07:50,906 --> 00:07:52,532
One of your previous incarnations

125
00:07:52,616 --> 00:07:54,117
tried to slay me--

126
00:07:54,201 --> 00:07:56,828
Maybe 800 or 900 years ago.

127
00:07:57,371 --> 00:07:58,788
I didn't know that.

128
00:07:59,790 --> 00:08:02,917
Why did he-- Or I-- Try to kill you?

129
00:08:03,419 --> 00:08:05,587
It was something about

130
00:08:05,671 --> 00:08:07,630
stealing the face
of someone you loved.

131
00:08:15,514 --> 00:08:18,266
Of course, that's all behind us.

132
00:08:18,601 --> 00:08:20,268
Why should I hold a grudge against you

133
00:08:20,352 --> 00:08:21,728
for something in a past life?

134
00:08:22,271 --> 00:08:24,522
After all--
You're a different person now.

135
00:08:24,607 --> 00:08:27,901
You've come to me with a new face.

136
00:08:33,532 --> 00:08:35,158
Guess we'll be here awhile.

137
00:08:38,621 --> 00:08:39,662
Don't worry.

138
00:08:39,747 --> 00:08:40,955
Prince Zuko can't be getting too far

139
00:08:41,040 --> 00:08:42,457
in this weather.

140
00:08:42,917 --> 00:08:45,126
I'm not worried
they'll get away in the blizzard.

141
00:08:45,544 --> 00:08:47,212
I'm worried that they won't.

142
00:08:47,296 --> 00:08:49,088
They're not gonna
die in this blizzard.

143
00:08:49,173 --> 00:08:51,758
If we know anything,
it's that Zuko never gives up.

144
00:08:52,134 --> 00:08:54,886
They'll survive-- And we'll find them.

145
00:08:55,471 --> 00:08:56,846
It's been a long time

146
00:08:56,931 --> 00:08:59,933
since I've added
a child's face to my collection.

147
00:09:00,309 --> 00:09:01,309
So...

148
00:09:01,602 --> 00:09:03,353
How may I help you?

149
00:09:03,604 --> 00:09:06,022
I need to find
the moon and the ocean.

150
00:09:06,232 --> 00:09:09,859
Their spirit names
are "Tui" and "La--"

151
00:09:10,444 --> 00:09:12,821
Push and pull.

152
00:09:12,905 --> 00:09:14,739
And that has been the nature

153
00:09:14,824 --> 00:09:17,367
of their relationship for all time.

154
00:09:17,535 --> 00:09:19,702
Please, help me find them.

155
00:09:20,287 --> 00:09:22,205
An entire culture could be destroyed

156
00:09:22,331 --> 00:09:23,832
if I don't get their help.

157
00:09:23,999 --> 00:09:26,918
You think you need their help?

158
00:09:27,127 --> 00:09:29,712
Actually, it's quite
the other way around.

159
00:09:30,589 --> 00:09:33,132
Someone is going to kill them!

160
00:09:33,384 --> 00:09:34,717
What do you mean?

161
00:09:34,927 --> 00:09:36,511
How can I find them and protect them?

162
00:09:37,137 --> 00:09:39,973
You've already met them, actually.

163
00:09:40,724 --> 00:09:44,561
Tui and La-- Your moon and ocean--

164
00:09:44,895 --> 00:09:47,730
Have always circled each other
in an eternal dance.

165
00:09:48,023 --> 00:09:50,108
They balance each other:

166
00:09:50,192 --> 00:09:53,027
push and pull, life and death,

167
00:09:53,237 --> 00:09:55,572
good and evil...

168
00:09:55,781 --> 00:09:57,699
Yin and Yang.

169
00:10:02,121 --> 00:10:03,204
The koi fish!

170
00:10:05,624 --> 00:10:07,208
I must be going now.

171
00:10:08,002 --> 00:10:09,669
We'll meet again.

172
00:10:15,092 --> 00:10:16,509
The spirits are in trouble!

173
00:10:16,594 --> 00:10:18,219
I need to get back
to the physical world!

174
00:10:18,470 --> 00:10:21,890
A friend is here to guide you back.

175
00:10:21,974 --> 00:10:22,974
Hei Bai!

176
00:11:13,859 --> 00:11:15,318
We'll be following this map

177
00:11:15,486 --> 00:11:17,153
to a very special location.

178
00:11:17,488 --> 00:11:19,197
And when we get there...

179
00:11:19,281 --> 00:11:21,366
We're going fishing.

180
00:11:25,287 --> 00:11:26,579
This is where I came in...

181
00:11:26,664 --> 00:11:28,206
But how do I get back?

182
00:11:35,881 --> 00:11:37,131
Good riddance.

183
00:11:42,388 --> 00:11:44,013
Momo!

184
00:11:44,348 --> 00:11:45,515
Momo?

185
00:11:45,599 --> 00:11:46,599
No...

186
00:11:46,892 --> 00:11:47,892
Where's my body?

187
00:11:55,192 --> 00:11:56,234
Look!

188
00:11:56,318 --> 00:11:57,318
That's got to be Aang!

189
00:11:57,403 --> 00:11:58,444
Yip, yip!

190
00:12:08,455 --> 00:12:09,455
Welcome back.

191
00:12:09,707 --> 00:12:10,707
Good to be back.

192
00:12:18,090 --> 00:12:19,966
That won't be enough to escape.

193
00:12:20,801 --> 00:12:21,801
Appa!

194
00:12:25,305 --> 00:12:26,305
Whoa!

195
00:12:26,390 --> 00:12:27,390
Here for a rematch?

196
00:12:27,766 --> 00:12:29,100
Trust me, Zuko,

197
00:12:29,268 --> 00:12:30,685
it's not going to be much of a match.

198
00:12:37,234 --> 00:12:39,694
Hey, this is some quality rope.

199
00:12:39,778 --> 00:12:41,237
We need to get to the oasis!

200
00:12:41,697 --> 00:12:42,864
The spirits are in trouble.

201
00:12:47,703 --> 00:12:49,871
Wait-- We can't just leave him here.

202
00:12:50,414 --> 00:12:51,414
Sure, we can.

203
00:12:51,498 --> 00:12:52,498
Let's go.

204
00:12:52,583 --> 00:12:53,583
No.

205
00:12:53,667 --> 00:12:55,084
If we leave him, he'll die.

206
00:12:59,214 --> 00:13:00,548
Yeah, this makes
a lot of sense--

207
00:13:00,632 --> 00:13:03,301
Let's bring the guy
who's constantly trying to kill us.

208
00:13:35,459 --> 00:13:36,459
Are you ok?

209
00:13:36,543 --> 00:13:37,919
I feel faint.

210
00:13:38,087 --> 00:13:39,212
I feel it, too.

211
00:13:41,256 --> 00:13:43,049
The moon spirit is in trouble.

212
00:13:43,342 --> 00:13:45,426
I owe the moon spirit my life.

213
00:13:45,511 --> 00:13:46,511
What do you mean?

214
00:13:46,887 --> 00:13:48,054
When I was born,

215
00:13:48,138 --> 00:13:50,431
I was very sick and very weak.

216
00:13:51,100 --> 00:13:53,101
Most babies cry when they're born,

217
00:13:53,602 --> 00:13:55,686
but I was born as if I were asleep,

218
00:13:55,771 --> 00:13:57,105
my eyes closed.

219
00:13:57,439 --> 00:14:00,191
Our healers did everything they could.

220
00:14:00,567 --> 00:14:03,444
They told my mother and father
I was going to die.

221
00:14:04,279 --> 00:14:07,073
My father pleaded
with the spirits to save me.

222
00:14:07,699 --> 00:14:09,909
That night-- Beneath the full moon--

223
00:14:09,993 --> 00:14:13,538
He brought me to the oasis
and placed me in the pond.

224
00:14:13,622 --> 00:14:15,706
My dark hair turned white.

225
00:14:16,208 --> 00:14:18,459
I opened my eyes and began to cry...

226
00:14:18,544 --> 00:14:19,752
Waah!

227
00:14:19,837 --> 00:14:21,212
And they knew I would live.

228
00:14:22,131 --> 00:14:24,340
That's why my mother named me Yue,

229
00:14:24,424 --> 00:14:25,675
for the moon.

230
00:14:28,929 --> 00:14:32,348
I am a legend now.

231
00:14:32,766 --> 00:14:34,559
The Fire Nation will for generations

232
00:14:34,643 --> 00:14:36,727
tell stories about the Great Zhao,

233
00:14:36,812 --> 00:14:38,771
who darkened the moon.

234
00:14:39,439 --> 00:14:42,316
They will call me
Zhao the Conqueror...

235
00:14:42,401 --> 00:14:44,443
Zhao the Moon-slayer...

236
00:14:44,778 --> 00:14:47,196
Zhao the Invincible!

237
00:14:48,365 --> 00:14:50,908
Get it off!

238
00:14:59,751 --> 00:15:01,002
Don't bother.

239
00:15:02,921 --> 00:15:04,922
Zhao, don't!

240
00:15:05,382 --> 00:15:07,008
It's my destiny...

241
00:15:07,092 --> 00:15:09,260
To destroy the moon

242
00:15:09,344 --> 00:15:10,887
and the Water Tribe.

243
00:15:11,221 --> 00:15:12,388
Destroying the moon

244
00:15:12,472 --> 00:15:14,432
won't just hurt the Water Tribe,

245
00:15:15,100 --> 00:15:16,559
It will hurt everyone--

246
00:15:16,643 --> 00:15:17,935
Including you.

247
00:15:18,520 --> 00:15:19,687
Without the moon,

248
00:15:19,771 --> 00:15:21,731
everything would fall out of balance--

249
00:15:21,815 --> 00:15:24,108
You have no idea what kind of chaos

250
00:15:24,193 --> 00:15:25,568
that would unleash on the world.

251
00:15:25,819 --> 00:15:27,278
He's right, Zhao.

252
00:15:27,779 --> 00:15:29,488
General Iroh,

253
00:15:29,573 --> 00:15:31,240
why am I not surprised

254
00:15:31,325 --> 00:15:32,825
to discover your treachery?

255
00:15:33,035 --> 00:15:35,036
I'm no traitor, Zhao.

256
00:15:35,120 --> 00:15:37,330
The Fire Nation needs the moon, too.

257
00:15:37,414 --> 00:15:39,999
We all depend on the balance.

258
00:15:40,876 --> 00:15:43,002
Whatever you do to that spirit,

259
00:15:43,086 --> 00:15:45,630
I'll unleash on you tenfold!

260
00:15:45,923 --> 00:15:47,298
Let it go now!

261
00:16:29,049 --> 00:16:30,800
There's no hope now.

262
00:16:31,426 --> 00:16:32,635
It's over.

263
00:16:34,805 --> 00:16:35,805
No...

264
00:16:35,889 --> 00:16:36,973
It's not over.

265
00:17:53,258 --> 00:17:54,300
You're alive?!

266
00:17:54,551 --> 00:17:56,135
You tried to have me killed!

267
00:17:59,556 --> 00:18:00,723
Yes, I did.

268
00:18:01,224 --> 00:18:02,767
You're the Blue Spirit--

269
00:18:02,851 --> 00:18:04,852
An enemy of the Fire Nation!

270
00:18:05,354 --> 00:18:07,146
You freed the Avatar.

271
00:18:07,481 --> 00:18:08,606
I had no choice!

272
00:18:12,527 --> 00:18:15,029
You should have chosen
to accept your failure,

273
00:18:15,322 --> 00:18:16,906
your disgrace...

274
00:18:17,115 --> 00:18:19,700
Then at least you could have lived.

275
00:18:31,380 --> 00:18:32,671
It's too late--

276
00:18:33,423 --> 00:18:34,423
It's dead.

277
00:18:38,136 --> 00:18:40,554
You have been touched
by the moon spirit.

278
00:18:40,972 --> 00:18:43,057
Some of its life is in you.

279
00:18:43,392 --> 00:18:45,684
Yes, you're right...

280
00:18:45,894 --> 00:18:48,145
It gave me life.

281
00:18:48,939 --> 00:18:50,481
Maybe I can give it back.

282
00:18:51,650 --> 00:18:52,733
No!

283
00:18:52,818 --> 00:18:53,901
You don't have to do that.

284
00:18:54,486 --> 00:18:56,028
It's my duty, Sokka.

285
00:18:56,113 --> 00:18:57,613
I won't let you.

286
00:18:57,697 --> 00:18:59,824
Your father told me to protect you!

287
00:18:59,908 --> 00:19:01,075
I have to do this.

288
00:19:14,464 --> 00:19:15,464
No!

289
00:19:17,884 --> 00:19:20,594
She's gone.

290
00:20:20,155 --> 00:20:21,947
Good-bye, Sokka.

291
00:20:22,407 --> 00:20:24,033
I'll always be with you.

292
00:21:04,115 --> 00:21:05,324
It can't be!

293
00:21:16,044 --> 00:21:17,086
Take my hand!

294
00:21:34,229 --> 00:21:36,730
I've decided to go to the South Pole.

295
00:21:36,815 --> 00:21:39,316
Some other benders and healers
want to join me.

296
00:21:39,401 --> 00:21:41,944
It's time we helped rebuild
our sister tribe.

297
00:21:42,571 --> 00:21:43,821
What about Aang?

298
00:21:43,905 --> 00:21:45,906
He still needs to learn waterbending.

299
00:21:45,991 --> 00:21:48,325
Well-- Then he better get used to

300
00:21:48,410 --> 00:21:50,661
calling you Master Katara.

301
00:21:53,373 --> 00:21:55,499
The spirits gave me a vision

302
00:21:55,584 --> 00:21:56,875
when Yue was born.

303
00:21:57,210 --> 00:21:59,003
I saw a beautiful,

304
00:21:59,087 --> 00:22:03,424
brave young woman
become the moon spirit.

305
00:22:04,509 --> 00:22:05,926
I knew this day would come.

306
00:22:06,386 --> 00:22:07,720
You must be proud.

307
00:22:07,804 --> 00:22:09,388
So proud...

308
00:22:10,473 --> 00:22:11,473
And sad.

309
00:22:13,768 --> 00:22:16,270
I'm surprised, Prince Zuko,

310
00:22:16,479 --> 00:22:17,730
Surprised that you are not

311
00:22:17,814 --> 00:22:20,858
at this moment
trying to capture the Avatar.

312
00:22:21,693 --> 00:22:22,985
I'm tired.

313
00:22:23,069 --> 00:22:24,945
Then you should rest.

314
00:22:25,822 --> 00:22:27,740
A man needs his rest.

315
00:22:45,550 --> 00:22:46,842
You, too, Momo!

316
00:22:46,926 --> 00:22:47,926
Come here!

317
00:22:58,813 --> 00:23:01,273
Iroh is a traitor,

318
00:23:01,358 --> 00:23:04,151
and your brother Zuko is a failure.

319
00:23:04,694 --> 00:23:07,237
I have a task for you...
